      "content": "but you dont get it. it's not just about me being unhappy. it's like... their whole legacy, their sacrifices, it's all tied to me succeeding. now that i've messed up, it feels like i've just wasted their entire lives. i look at them and i just feel this massive amount of shame. i feel like i'd be better off if i just wasn't a part of this anymore, you know? like the shame would just go away.",
